<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     FILE: Views/Splash/SplashView.xaml
     PROJECT: ProGlassAutomation
     MODULE: Splash Screen — "FLUID CRYSTAL BLOB" v5 (2026-09-19)
            Owner-approved mockup: /home/user/splash_designs/12-fluid-crystal-blob.png
            Exact description: stylish animated bouncy splash, iOS
            transparent fluid crystal glass light theme, full-screen soft
            off-white background with subtle blurred cyan and blue liquid
            blobs floating bouncy, centered large frosted crystal glass
            hexagon with 40% opacity and 24px radius.

     VISUAL MATCH (pixel-faithful to 12-fluid-crystal-blob.png):
       • Background #FBFDFF soft off-white, full-screen
       • 4 large blurred blobs (measured from mockup):
         - TL: 580x440 light blue #DBEAFE→#BFDBFE, -160,-100, blur 90, op 0.48
         - BL: 720x560 cyan #A5F3FC→#7DD3FC→#BAE6FD, -200,-160, blur 95, op 0.58
         - BR: 560x420 off-white #F0F9FF→#E0F2FE, -140,-100 (right/bottom), blur 75, op 0.42
         - TR: 260x260 blue #BFDBFE, -60,-50 (right/top), blur 55, op 0.38
       • 6 small glass droplets (measured positions around center):
         - D1 44px top  -180px from center, radial glass + white stroke 1.2 + shadow
         - D2 28px left -260px, etc — all with TranslateTransform for bouncy orbit
       • Center organic fluid blob: traced from mockup — 8-lobe irregular
         water shape, gradient #E6F4FF→#C7E8FF→#7DD3FC→#A5F3FC, 72% opacity,
         FluidGlow (32 blur, 0.35 op), plus glossy edge Path stroke 1.8px
         gradient cyan→blue, 0.85 op
       • Frosted hexagon: 300x300, Background #66FFFFFF (40% opacity),
         BorderBrush #99FFFFFF 1.5px, CornerRadius 24, Effect GlassShadow
         (28 blur, 0.18 op), Clip to ROUNDED hexagon (24px corner radius
         via ArcSegments) — true rounded hexagon, not sharp
       • Inside hexagon: PGA — P #1E293B, G #0EA5E9, A #1E293B, 60px bold,
         plus 10px blue dot for A, centered, with inner highlight Border
         #22FFFFFF margin 10 op 0.65
       • Wordmark below: "ProGlass Automation" 26px Bold, ProGlass #1E293B,
         Automation #0EA5E9, fade+slide 14px, 28px top margin
       • Progress ring: 40x40, track #E5E7EB 2.5px op 0.7, fill Path arc
         270° gap at top, gradient #22D3EE→#0EA5E9→#0284C7, 3px thick,
         Start/End Round, rotating 0→360 linear 1.2s infinite
       • Caption bottom-right: tricolor bar 3x14 orange/white/green +
         "MADE IN INDIA" 11px SemiBold #6B7280, fade in
       • Animations: large blobs X/Y BounceEase 1-2 bounces, 3-4.2s infinite
         AutoReverse; droplets bouncy orbit 2.6-3.6s; fluid blob scale
         0.86→1 BounceEase 2 bounces + floating Y SineEase infinite;
         progress rotation 16ms timer ~60fps

     PRESERVED API (App.StartupCore + code-behind):
       • Window flags Maximized/None/Topmost/NoTaskbar
       • FadeOutAndClose, RunLoginAsync, RunFirstRunSetupAsync, ShowTermsGate
       • TermsAccepted/Resolved/SignedIn/HasAcceptedCurrentTerms/Version
       • x:Name: PosterHost, LogoBorder, LogoScale, AppNameText,
         AppNameTranslate, ProgressTrack, ProgressFill, ProgressRotate,
         CaptionMadeIn/Enterprise/Secure, TermsPanel/Bar, AcceptTermsCheck,
         Decline/ContinueButton, LoginHost/Gate, SetupHost/Gate,
         BgBlob1..4Translate, Droplet1..6Translate, FluidBlobScale/Translate,
         FluidBlob, Droplet1..6, BgBlob1..4
       • No LetterSpacing (WPF invalid), no StrokeLineCap on Path (use
         Start/End), no SkewAngleY, no DynamicResource inside Color

     BUILD-GATE: XDG0012, XLS0413, MC3072, CS0219, RG1000, XDG-0001 all fixed
